# The demo key (.secrets/) is deliberately COMMITTED in this example: its XOR
# parts are committed in lib/model_master_key.dart anyway, and the transformer
# needs the key file on every `flutter build`, including a fresh clone.
# A real app must gitignore it — `dart run litert_crypto keygen` says so.
